  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hi, Brian.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 14.56,
      "end_time": 15.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, Ahmed.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 15.12,
      "end_time": 15.72
    },
    {
      "text": "How you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 15.72,
      "end_time": 16.239
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm good, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 16.96,
      "end_time": 17.92
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 17.92,
      "end_time": 18.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Very good, very good.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 18.96,
      "end_time": 19.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for asking.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 19.96,
      "end_time": 20.64
    },
    {
      "text": "How was your vacation?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 21.2,
      "end_time": 22.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I think you were on vacation because I tried to email you and I got that autoresponder.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 22.68,
      "end_time": 27.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 27.85,
      "end_time": 28.41
    },
    {
      "text": "So how.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 28.97,
      "end_time": 29.53
    },
    {
      "text": "How was.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 29.61,
      "end_time": 30.25
    },
    {
      "text": "How was it?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 30.33,
      "end_time": 31.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I went to Italy for a week, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 31.45,
      "end_time": 33.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Down the Amalfi coast.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 33.37,
      "end_time": 34.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 36.33,
      "end_time": 36.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Good times, good memories, all things.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 38.41,
      "end_time": 40.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's a beautiful weather to be in Italy afterwards, especially if you're in the uk.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 41.45,
      "end_time": 47.37
    },
    {
      "text": "I can kind of understand.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 47.37,
      "end_time": 48.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, we.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 50.89,
      "end_time": 51.45
    },
    {
      "text": "We've had quite good weather in May, but nothing like over there.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 51.45,
      "end_time": 55.53
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 55.53,
      "end_time": 56.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 56.05,
      "end_time": 57.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Richard.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 58.73,
      "end_time": 59.57
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 59.57,
      "end_time": 60.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Good.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 60.57,
      "end_time": 60.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I made yourself.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 60.89,
      "end_time": 61.69
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm good, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 62.49,
      "end_time": 63.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Good, good.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 63.93,
      "end_time": 64.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just check if Chris is on his way.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 67.93,
      "end_time": 69.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 70.57,
      "end_time": 71.37
    },
    {
      "text": "It.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 80.11,
      "end_time": 80.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Joining us.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 106.44,
      "end_time": 107
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 109.56,
      "end_time": 110.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And there's actually in a middle of a client called closing a deal.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 110.2,
      "end_time": 114.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So he's actually.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 115.24,
      "end_time": 116.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, yeah, it's gonna be us.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 119.16,
      "end_time": 121.719
    },
    {
      "text": "It's really up there.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 122.36,
      "end_time": 123.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Call.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 123.92,
      "end_time": 124.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I will have these every a week or five weeks.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 124.52,
      "end_time": 128.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Every once for you guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 128.84,
      "end_time": 133.249
    },
    {
      "text": "One percent I have.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 134.289,
      "end_time": 140.849
    },
    {
      "text": "I know blind, but.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 142.849,
      "end_time": 143.889
    },
    {
      "text": "Richard, did I add you to the email thread?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 144.209,
      "end_time": 147.009
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry, I couldn't hear that.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 148.769,
      "end_time": 149.969
    },
    {
      "text": "The email trend.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 150.689,
      "end_time": 151.609
    },
    {
      "text": "Did I add you to the email thread when I sent the weekly updates?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 151.609,
      "end_time": 155.569
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I didn't get it.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 155.649,
      "end_time": 156.609
    },
    {
      "text": "Brian forwarded me the email, but I didn't get the invitation.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 156.769,
      "end_time": 160.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 161.83,
      "end_time": 162.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Brian, you're on mute.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 165.51,
      "end_time": 166.63
    },
    {
      "text": "There was the invitation and then there was the email email update.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 169.99,
      "end_time": 173.59
    },
    {
      "text": "I think the last email I had was Thursday.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 178.55,
      "end_time": 180.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just check.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 180.47,
      "end_time": 181.35
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, was Thursday.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 182.23,
      "end_time": 183.27
    },
    {
      "text": "It was about getting NDAs approved and the IM.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 184.07,
      "end_time": 187.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we got three at the moment.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 188.93,
      "end_time": 190.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that right?",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 190.33,
      "end_time": 190.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 191.33,
      "end_time": 192.13
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have one from Friday.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 192.13,
      "end_time": 193.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I've got the.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 194.45,
      "end_time": 195.17
    },
    {
      "text": "The update in the IM on Friday.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 195.33,
      "end_time": 197.49
    },
    {
      "text": "Everybody.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 199.97,
      "end_time": 200.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Agency.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 200.53,
      "end_time": 201.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Everybody.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 201.57,
      "end_time": 202.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so we have like three signed in days and then two agencies that we are speaking to and we're expecting sign as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 202.369,
      "end_time": 209.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 211.17,
      "end_time": 211.73
    },
    {
      "text": "And have those guys seen the valuation or have they yet to see it?",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 213.18,
      "end_time": 216.46
    },
    {
      "text": "No, it's valuation expectations.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 216.78,
      "end_time": 218.82
    },
    {
      "text": "We haven't accepted them and we wanted them to get on a call with you guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 218.82,
      "end_time": 223.46
    },
    {
      "text": "And then there's these guys are really just seeing the teaser and Richard, I think we were not on that call, so we removed the valuation just so we get more interest from the people.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 223.46,
      "end_time": 236.46
    },
    {
      "text": "We.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 237.42,
      "end_time": 237.74
    },
    {
      "text": "We tend to get more impressed when we don't have like a validation set up.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 237.74,
      "end_time": 241.22
    },
    {
      "text": "And then to get a more interested pool of buyers at the moment we.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 241.22,
      "end_time": 246.57
    },
    {
      "text": "We have one call set up with Chris as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 246.57,
      "end_time": 249.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let me just give Chris a phone because I Don't want him to miss the meeting.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 251.21,
      "end_time": 256.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, Slow point and update if Chris isn't here.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 256.57,
      "end_time": 259.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 260.17,
      "end_time": 260.65
    },
    {
      "text": "So is this normal to have three at this stage?",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 263.77,
      "end_time": 266.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there outreach next that you need to do or how does it work?",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 268.16,
      "end_time": 271.68
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have like ongoing outreach efforts at the moment.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 272.08,
      "end_time": 275.92
    },
    {
      "text": "We have outreaches going on and we get in parties and then we pre screen them like if you don't know them but like the buyers we have at the moment we know them.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 275.92,
      "end_time": 289.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So we are, we set them up directly with that because they have points out.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 289.36,
      "end_time": 293.96
    },
    {
      "text": "There she is.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 293.96,
      "end_time": 294.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Chris isn't answering.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 298.99,
      "end_time": 299.67
    },
    {
      "text": "I've sent him a teamus as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 299.67,
      "end_time": 301.03
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 301.03,
      "end_time": 301.39
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean we can reschedule.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 311.39,
      "end_time": 313.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Well I guess the main update is the three companies are interested.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 317.87,
      "end_time": 322.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You say you have meeting set up with Chris for one of them already.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 322.6,
      "end_time": 325.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 326.44,
      "end_time": 326.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So Quanta, we know them and we have spoken to them many times.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 326.88,
      "end_time": 331.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So they're interested and we have set up a call with them on so 16th of June it's called the first and they have the IM, they have seen the IM.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 331.88,
      "end_time": 357.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're really hoping for a good call.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 359.41,
      "end_time": 362.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we have the other two ones.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 362.61,
      "end_time": 364.29
    },
    {
      "text": "They have DNAs, they have, you know they're like running it down their chain, up their chains.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 364.29,
      "end_time": 369.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 369.25,
      "end_time": 369.57
    },
    {
      "text": "They said they're all going to come back to me in this week or in the next week and we'll schedule a call with them and then we have another two agencies.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 370.13,
      "end_time": 378.35
    },
    {
      "text": "I can, I can send it over on email so you guys are able to visit the website as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 379.31,
      "end_time": 385.71
    },
    {
      "text": "So one of them is called SALT Agency, their us and we're setting up a call with them.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 385.95,
      "end_time": 393.19
    },
    {
      "text": "They're again having a board meeting to discuss and then they'll kind of come back to us and then we have Nintendo their New York based and we know that guy as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 393.19,
      "end_time": 406.26
    },
    {
      "text": "We are spinning him today for a call and you know of course approved.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 406.42,
      "end_time": 413.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Get the imo.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 413.14,
      "end_time": 414.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you hear us?",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 431.23,
      "end_time": 431.87
    },
    {
      "text": "I can hear you.",
      "speaker_name": "Lee-Anne Lindsay",
      "start_time": 432.83,
      "end_time": 433.71
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not sure why my video is not working.",
      "speaker_name": "Lee-Anne Lindsay",
      "start_time": 433.95,
      "end_time": 435.95
    },
    {
      "text": "You can carry your numbers.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 448.19,
      "end_time": 449.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 450.6,
      "end_time": 450.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's really the update for this week.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 450.84,
      "end_time": 454.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Our proof is going on.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 455.56,
      "end_time": 456.84
    },
    {
      "text": "We're expecting more to come in down the line but yeah for the timing we're setting up calls with these and expect.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 456.84,
      "end_time": 464.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so we've got three that we know of and then there's two more that you're going to send over.",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 465.959,
      "end_time": 470.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 471.08,
      "end_time": 471.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So three of them are have signed the NDA and they have the image.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 471.92,
      "end_time": 475.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Two of them we're explaining basically.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 475.93,
      "end_time": 477.73
    },
    {
      "text": "So they're interested as an interest on the teaser on initial but we Would scan them just to be more sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 477.73,
      "end_time": 485.93
    },
    {
      "text": "That's like.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 488.49,
      "end_time": 489.05
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have like five in the play at the moment.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 489.05,
      "end_time": 491.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 491.77,
      "end_time": 492.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Any questions?",
      "speaker_name": "Brian Fitzpatrick",
      "start_time": 497.13,
      "end_time": 498.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, no.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 498.49,
      "end_time": 499.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there a central spreadsheet somewhere, Ahmed, that this is all held that we can just keep reverting back to?",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 499.77,
      "end_time": 503.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 504.5,
      "end_time": 505.26
