      "start_time": 507.22,
      "end_time": 509.86
    },
    {
      "text": "But I mean if you guys prefer.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 510.1,
      "end_time": 512.18
    },
    {
      "text": "A spreadsheet, I'm happy for you to send emails of updates, but so that we've got it centralized somewhere so we.",
