      "start_time": 553.02,
      "end_time": 559.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So the other two signed NDA parties, they're reviewing the opportunity.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 559.8,
      "end_time": 564.28
    },
    {
      "text": "They're a big company so they kind of have to have that process of sending it up the chain and getting it approved.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 565.16,
      "end_time": 571.72
