      "end_time": 653.18
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd like to be on the call, but I just can't do Wednesday.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 653.5,
      "end_time": 655.9
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't know anything about.",
