      "start_time": 683.38,
      "end_time": 685.78
    },
    {
      "text": "I do understand that.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 685.78,
      "end_time": 686.78
    },
    {
      "text": "I just, I'd rather be on the first couple with Christopher.",
