      "start_time": 802.41,
      "end_time": 803.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we had, we had that issue with another client as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 803.61,
      "end_time": 806.73
    },
    {
      "text": "I think teams at Google go along.",
