      "start_time": 812.33,
      "end_time": 813.61
    },
    {
      "text": "I can, I can.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 815.93,
      "end_time": 816.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 816.73,
      "end_time": 817.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 818.97,
      "end_time": 819.53
    },
    {
      "text": "So any details from.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 819.85,
      "end_time": 823.95
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, we're good from our side, so as we go down to the process, so see if we can.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 823.95,
      "end_time": 829.47
    },
    {
      "text": "But at the moment we're getting.",
